Linux shell variables:
Common Shell Variable Operations
Operation	  Example	                     Explanation
Define	    greeting="Hello"	           Set a variable
Access	    echo $greeting	             Retrieve value
Append	    greeting="$greeting World"	 Append text
Unset	      unset greeting	             Delete a variable
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Shell Special Variables
Variable	    Meaning
$0	          Script name
$1, $2...	    Arguments to script
$#	          Number of arguments
$@	          All arguments
$$	          PID of script
$?	          Exit status of last command

